      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to see a solution similar to the Holoport feature where the player data and avatar move as a 3rd person entity but the Main Menu and general tracking data are frozen like in the provided picture. This would be overridden when a Teleport occurs that updates the position of all of these elements together in unison.\n\nHere are two videos showing the tracking data pulled from a player experiencing the issue.\n\nGuide on Visuals:\n\nTop is Local, Bottom is Remote.\n\nShapes on the floor meaning:\n\n- Circle = Player Controller (GetPosition/GetRotation)\n\n- Square = Play Space Root\n\n- Triangle = Avatar Root",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
